    "introduction": "Polar Capital Technology Trust is a listed investment trust specialising in technology and technology-related companies around the world. Its investment manager selects holdings within that broad theme, giving shareholders exposure to areas such as computing, software and digital infrastructure through a single vehicle. Returns reflect changes in portfolio values and income after fees and other costs. The trust's share price may trade at a discount or premium to its net asset value. Its sector focus distinguishes it from diversified global funds, with results influenced by technological change, competitive shifts and how much investors are willing to pay for the companies it holds.",
